    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel Run is a 3D arcade-style hack and slash that puts players in the lead roles of popular movie archetypes. In this action-packed game, players face off against hordes of enemies across multiple genre-themed levels, each styled to emulate the film\u2019s era while keeping a fun, arcade-like energy. This blend of unique visual styles, intense combat, and familiar movie tropes brings a nostalgic yet fresh experience that makes players feel like true action heroes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is unique and puts you in a different film genre. Feel like the main character and fight through waves of enemies to accomplish your goal in each film as the main character!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a unique playable character with varied combat abilities and moves to play any way you want!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break things! Destruction is necessary to be a true action star! Break the enviroment in fun ways mid scene to get the best take possible.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel Run is a 3D arcade-style hack and slash that puts players in the lead roles of popular movie archetypes. In this action-packed game, players face off against hordes of enemies across multiple genre-themed levels, each styled to emulate the film\u2019s era while keeping a fun, arcade-like energy. This blend of unique visual styles, intense combat, and familiar movie tropes brings a nostalgic yet fresh experience that makes players feel like true action heroes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is unique and puts you in a different film genre. Feel like the main character and fight through waves of enemies to accomplish your goal in each film as the main character!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a unique playable character with varied combat abilities and moves to play any way you want!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break things! Destruction is necessary to be a true action star! Break the enviroment in fun ways mid scene to get the best take possible.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
